// Spells: all are made by tools/import_class_spells.py (the generated block at the end): every rank the class trainers of the original teach, each with
// its own tome (an item of items.ron with a `tome`) that asks for a rank of the class skill (`level`), and the original's numbers. `cost` is mana or stamina, `cooldown` seconds. The effect is `Damage` (the
// selected creature within `range` yards), `Area` (every enemy within `radius` yards of the caster), `Heal` (the caster) or `Classic` (run from the original's
// spell). Numbers grow with the rank of the class skill, which casting trains. `spell` is the row of the original's Spell.dbc whose cast time, pictures
// (SpellVisual.dbc: what shows on the hands while it is cast, the missile, what shows where it hits) and sounds it has. Icons are names
// in Interface\Icons.
